# generated by explainer/gen/map/ (build_map.py, build_neuronmap.py, push_words.py, build_graphs.py). Only the files
# the neuron map page reads are committed (about 32 MB); the lookup pages' data (c/, cs/, findings, tokens...) is not,
# because those pages are not released yet.
data/*
!data/neuronmap.json
!data/concepts.json
!data/n/
!data/push/
!data/graphs/
